      "writtenOn": "2026-09-28T23:29:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done.\n\nSince `BudgetedBuffer` already defines `begin()`, `end()`, `data()`, and `size()`, it satisfies both `std::ranges::contiguous_range` and `std::ranges::sized_range`. Added static_asserts for both `BudgetedBuffer` and `const BudgetedBuffer` to lock this in at compile time, thanks!",
